                    }
                ],
                "steps": [
                    {
                        "step": "The growth medium contains the following components (per liter): "
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "Combine the distilled water and Solutions 1,3,4 in an Erlenmeyer flask and dispense into glass serum bottles."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "Flush the headspace of the serum bottles with pure N2. Seal the serum bottles with butyl rubber stoppers and crimp seals. Using a syringe and needle, inject pure methane and oxygen to final headspace concentrations of 5-10% CH4 and 21% O2."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "Autoclave the serum bottles for 20 minutes at 121 \u00b0C."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "Upon cooling to room temperature, add Solutions 2 and 5 from a filter-sterilized stock solution."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "The final pH of the medium should be 7.8 - 7.9."
                    }
                ]
            },
